    "title": "Humans are not primates: We can change our environment - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago One of, not the only by far, my biggest pet peeves is when people say we’re primates. I see what Charles Darwin was saying, humans and primates are similar by DNA, physical and behavior characteristics, but similar is not the same. Humans share a wide variety of similarities with a wide variety of species, we did not evolve from primates, we are not primates. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
